    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Income before extraordinary items (ib) minus net cash flow (oancf) divided by absolute value of ib. If oancf is missing, PctAcc is defined as ( (act - act$_{t-12}$) - (che - che$_{t-12}$) - ( (lct - lct$_{t-12}$) - (dlc - dlc$_{t-12}$) - (txp - txp$_{t-12}$) - dp ) )/abs(ib). In either case, if ib is equal to 0, divide by .01 instead. Exclude if price less than 5. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.1；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=-1.0；TestInOP=port sort size adjusted。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>5。 Notes：Table 4 Panel A: Report size-adjusted return hedges with p-values; t-stat is approximate, I converted the p-value to t but not exact since the table says p <.001 instead of giving a value.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
